Modifications (2026-10-14):
  - Added src/input_layout_fix.inc: resolves D3D12_APPEND_ALIGNED_ELEMENT vertex input offsets
    before pipeline creation, working around D3DMetal fetching vertex attributes from wrong
    offsets (stretched geometry, noise textures in Arma Reforger).
  - Logging to dxgi_hook.log is disabled unless ENF_LOG=1.
  - Build switched to mingw-w64 (build.sh).
